This package is a Go port of the SGP4/SDP4 analytical satellite propagator
algorithm, originally described in:

    Vallado, D., Crawford, P., Hujsak, R., Kelso, T.S., "Revisiting
    Spacetrack Report #3," AIAA 2006-6753, presented at the AIAA/AAS
    Astrodynamics Specialist Conference, August 2006.
    https://celestrak.org/publications/AIAA/2006-6753/

The port was written and verified against the C++ reference implementation
distributed at https://github.com/CelesTrak/fundamentals-of-astrodynamics
(`software/cpp/SGP4/SGP4/SGP4.cpp` + `SGP4.h`), David Vallado's canonical,
continuously-maintained distribution of that algorithm.

CelesTrak's own FAQ for the above paper states that this code and algorithm
may be used "for any purpose — personal or commercial — as you wish,"
conditioned on citing its source (see
https://celestrak.org/publications/AIAA/2006-6753/faq.php). This notice is
that citation. This package's own original Go source is separately licensed
under the MIT license in LICENSE.
